  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DEC Myanmar Earthquake Response Project Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The DEC Second Phase programme in Myanmar aims to strengthen the recovery and resilience of earthquake-affected communities, with a deliberate focus on the diverse needs of women, men, children, older persons, persons with disabilities, and marginalized or socially excluded groups.The programme seeks to contribute to the overall DEC Theory of Change by enabling affected populations to meet medium-term needs, restore livelihoods, and improve living conditions in a manner that is inclusive, dignified, and sustainable.</narrative>
  </description>
